00:00:29.598 --> 00:00:30.990
When is it actually considered

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.210
the start of holiday season?

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.144
- It depends on how depressed you are,

00:00:35.144 --> 00:00:35.947
because I feel like--

00:00:35.947 --> 00:00:37.132
- Seasons come and go,

00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:38.340
but family is forever,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.872
and so during the holiday season

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.868
