00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:48.421
and we're gonna help you out!

00:00:48.421 --> 00:00:49.487
- Facebook?

00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:50.626
That's so mod of you!

00:00:50.626 --> 00:00:51.183
- I know!

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:52.820
I felt like it's all in the theme.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.077
How to convince your family

00:00:54.077 --> 00:00:56.539
you love the food they made for you...

00:00:56.539 --> 00:00:57.913
And the gifts they give you!

00:00:57.913 --> 00:00:59.851
