00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.035
- Gifts are easier than food,

00:01:01.035 --> 00:01:02.394
because all you have
to do is say thank you.

00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:04.994
Giving gifts is literally just the moment

00:01:04.994 --> 00:01:07.315
